.problem
Program entered "TICK" subroutine without a cleared
acc and consequently falsely recognized "APT"
as being available, thereby proceeding to branch
according to "APT", resulting in program failure.
.solution
1. Clear acc as "TICK" routine is entered.
2. Found incorrect combination of a subroutine
call and a microinstruction written as one command.
